	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"Figure-rise Standard ULTRAMAN シリーズに-ACTION-仕様でZEROが登場！",
			"• 腹部関節は「可動優先時」と「LEDユニット（別売り）内蔵時」の２パターンの選択式。",
			"• LEDユニット（別売り）を胸部に収め、胸と目を光らせることができる。",
			"• SUIT Ver7.5の武装（別売り）を装備可能。",
			"• プラモデルオリジナル武装「ゼロランス」付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"ZERO is now available in the Figure-rise Standard ULTRAMAN series with -ACTION- specifications!",
			"• The abdominal joint can be selected from two patterns: \"when movable is prioritized\" and \"when the LED unit (sold separately) is built in\".",
			"• An LED unit (sold separately) can be placed in the chest to make the chest and eyes shine.",
			"• Can be equipped with SUIT Ver7.5 weapons (sold separately).",
			"• Includes plastic model original weapon \"Zero Lance\"."
		]
